local oTb=table.clone(zSb)
oTb.dmgMul,oTb._dk=CSb,nil
local pTb={}
for qTb,rTb in pairs(BSb or{})do
pTb[qTb]=rTb
end
pTb.dealt={}
local sTb=pcall(gb.runRaw,oTb,ASb,pTb)
local tTb={}
for uTb,vTb in pairs(type(KSb[LSb])==Ioe[2044]and KSb[LSb]or{})do
tTb[uTb]=vTb
end
if sTb then
local wTb,xTb={},0
